&lt;h3&gt;Big O Notation&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="big-o-notation"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#big-o-notation" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="此章节的永久链接"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;del&gt;A later chapter also covers this.&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Comparison of time complexities:&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="comparison-of-time-complexities"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#comparison-of-time-complexities" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="此章节的永久链接"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="../big_o.svg" alt="svg" loading="lazy" /&gt;
The differences between time complexities are huge (I didn&amp;rsquo;t include &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;O&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;!&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;O(n!)&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;"&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mopen"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mclose"&gt;!)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; - its growth rate is so large it would dwarf everything else).&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;c&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the constant factor of the time an algorithm needs. The actual running time is &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;O&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;∗&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;O(x)*c&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;"&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mopen"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mclose"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mbin"&gt;∗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, where &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;x&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;x&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; stands for any variable.&lt;br&gt;
But in general, the time contributed by &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;c&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is not counted, even if it is very large. &lt;del&gt;because the growth rate matters more.&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Computation: with recursion, it is generally &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;O&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;call stack height&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;∗&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;O&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;(&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;time per level&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mo stretchy="false"&gt;)&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;O(\text{call stack height}) * O(\text{time per level})&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;"&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mopen"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord text"&gt;&lt;span class="mord"&gt;call stack height&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mclose"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mbin"&gt;∗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;"&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mopen"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord text"&gt;&lt;span class="mord"&gt;time per level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mclose"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Worst Case vs. Average Case&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="worst-case-vs-average-case"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#worst-case-vs-average-case" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="此章节的永久链接"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Traveling Salesman Problem&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="traveling-salesman-problem"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#traveling-salesman-problem" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="此章节的永久链接"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a
href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1433"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;P1433 Eating Cheese&lt;/a&gt;
A classic traveling salesman problem (I don&amp;rsquo;t know how to solve it yet).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>